# UX workflow: quantized Drum Pattern preset audition while Transport plays.
# Purpose: proves that the same Factory workflow reports Next loop, becomes a
# live provisional Preview at the local boundary, and can still be cancelled
# without adding an Undo entry.
# Expect: capture_changed:drum_pattern_preset_queued=drum_pattern_preset_applied_preview, capture_changed:drum_pattern_preset_applied_preview=drum_pattern_preset_cancelled
# Expect: semantic:drum_pattern_preset_queued:mode=sequencer.pattern_preset.preview.queued, semantic:drum_pattern_preset_queued:outcome=queued, semantic:drum_pattern_preset_queued:reason=activation_pending
# Expect: semantic:drum_pattern_preset_applied_preview:mode=sequencer.pattern_preset.preview, semantic:drum_pattern_preset_applied_preview:projection=provisional
# Expect: semantic:drum_pattern_preset_cancelled:effect=cancel_pattern_preset_preview, semantic:drum_pattern_preset_cancelled:outcome=cancelled

0 scenario drum-sequencer

# Create Track 2 as a General MIDI Drum Track and author a visible phrase.
150 button NAV down
210 encoder NAV -1
270 button NAV up
330 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
1530 encoder NAV 1
1830 tap NAV 60
2300 encoder NAV 1
2650 tap NAV 60
3100 encoder NAV 1
3450 tap NAV 60
4350 tap MACRO_1 60
4550 tap MACRO_5 60
5000 encoder NAV 1
5150 tap MACRO_3 60
5350 tap MACRO_7 60

# Open Factory > House > Four on the floor through the Lane Editor hold path.
5650 tap NAV 60
5900 button NAV down
7000 tick
7100 button NAV up
7350 tick
7450 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
7750 tap NAV 60
8050 tap NAV 60

# Start Transport from the detail, return to its category and request audition.
8300 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
8450 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8650 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
8850 capture screen drum_pattern_preset_queued

# Four beats later the local loop boundary publishes the provisional candidate.
11050 capture screen drum_pattern_preset_applied_preview

# Back cancels the preview and restores the authored phrase; Transport remains global.
11250 tap LEFT_TOP 60
11450 capture screen drum_pattern_preset_cancelled
11650 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
